{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only, as per the CFO directive of 1 July 2026. [[cite:obs-55f345dd82dc0a69957793d2602caee070e3f0c1 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n\nWhere the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies. [[cite:obs-55f345dd82dc0a69957793d2602caee070e3f0c1 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"e31e71d9cb1410122f9937c8e2ab7f7bc8dc198533a9809cc945fbefd8d9d7fa","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Removed the statement about the procurement policy's 2000 EUR limit to comply with the requirement that only the CFO directive applies when there is a difference, and to avoid forbidden statements about 2000 EUR. Retained all statements supported by the CFO directive with exact citations."}